        "Turn on Remove animations in Accessibility, then open Radar, open Comms and turn pages. Nothing should slide or loop." to "在无障碍设置中开启“移除动画”，然后打开雷达、打开 Comms 并翻页。任何内容都不应滑动或循环播放。",
        "Set the font to its largest size (Developer options font scale for 200 percent). Look at home, Radar and Settings for cut-off text." to "把字体设为最大（开发者选项中的字体缩放可达 200%）。检查主屏幕、雷达和设置中是否有被截断的文字。",
