        "Open Radar, tap the microphone and speak a query. Note whether a speech engine answered and whether it works offline." to "打开雷达，点按麦克风并说出一个查询。记下语音引擎是否响应，以及能否离线使用。",
        "With a work profile on this phone, check that its apps carry the work badge in the drawer and in Radar results." to "如果此手机有工作资料，请检查其应用在抽屉和雷达结果中是否带有工作标识。",
        "Tap a notification that Liftoff shows (the hub or a preview). The app that posted it should open." to "点按 Liftoff 显示的通知（通知中心或预览）。发出该通知的应用应当打开。",
        "Connect an external display. Note whether Liftoff became its home or a desktop surface was offered (see the Lab row SPK-01 Displays)." to "连接外接显示器。记下 Liftoff 是否成为其主屏幕，或是否提供了桌面界面（见实验室中的 SPK-01 显示器一行）。",
