        "These checks need a real phone. Nothing is sent anywhere: Copy report puts plain text on the clipboard for you to paste back. A result here is evidence, not a verdict." to "这些检查需要真实手机。不会发送任何内容：“复制报告”会把纯文本放入剪贴板，供你粘贴回传。这里的结果只是证据，不是结论。",
